Subject: [PATCH 5/9] fix(tabs): unique tab ids, ignore Ctrl+N auto-repeat,
 persist post-switch manifest on close

- createCanvasTabId avoids duplicate ids when tabs are created in one ms.
- Ctrl+N handler ignores event.repeat (still preventDefault).
- performCloseCanvasTab re-derives remaining tabs after switchCanvasTab so a
  stale todoTabActive is not written back.
Tests: stability-tab-creation (4). Full suite: no new failures vs baseline.
